      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New MSA; renewal; market review
Frequency: Per MSA cycle + annual review
Volume: ~30–60 MSAs
Owner: Procurement Manager
Participants: Procurement Mgr (links to VS-34), Contingent Workforce Mgr, Finance, Legal, Agency
Source: workflow W3213 — Rate Negotiation, Benchmarking &amp; Master Services Agreement</bpmn:documentation>
