    <bpmn:process id="W_W3215" name="W3215. Worker Classification &amp; Co-Employment Risk Assessment" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New engagement; reclassification request; regulatory change; audit
Frequency: Per engagement + periodic
Volume: All ~30–60 contractor engagements + individual escalations
Owner: Labor Compliance Manager
Participants: Labor Compliance Mgr, Legal, HR (links to VS-84), Tax (links to VS-79), Contingent Workforce Mgr
Source: workflow W3215 — Worker Classification &amp; Co-Employment Risk Assessment</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3215_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3215_Lane1" name="Labor Compliance Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3215_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3215_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3215_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3215_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3215_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3215_Start3" name="New engagement; reclassification request; regulatory change; audit">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3215_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3215_Task4" name="Labor Compliance/Legal apply the four-fold test (selection/engagement, payment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Labor Compliance/Legal apply the four-fold test (selection/engagement, payment of wages, power of dismissal, power of control) and economic-reality factors to each engagement and to individual-worker escalations (e.g., a long-tenured &quot;contractor&quot; worker seeking regularization); document classification rationale
Responsible (R): Labor Compliance Mgr / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3215_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3215_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3215_Task5" name="Assess tax/ benefits exposure of misclassification: back wages, 13th month…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Assess tax/ benefits exposure of misclassification: back wages, 13th month, SIL, premium pay, SSS/PhilHealth/Pag-IBIG, tax withholding; quantify potential liability and reserve (links to VS-100 legal loss contingency W3277); plan remediation (convert to regular per W3230, or restructure engagement)
Responsible (R): Labor Compliance Mgr / Finance / Legal
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3215_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3215_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3215_Task6" name="Implement remediation and controls: convert confirmed employees to regular…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Implement remediation and controls: convert confirmed employees to regular (W3230) with back-pay; restructure borderline engagements; train supervisors (W3211); update risk register and monitor via audit (W3226)
Responsible (R): Labor Compliance Mgr / HR / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3215_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3215_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
