    <bpmn:process id="W_W3216" name="W3216. Contractor Renewal, Offboarding &amp; Replacement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Contract expiry; termination for cause; performance failure
Frequency: Per contract event
Volume: ~10–20 renewals/terminations/year
Owner: Contingent Workforce Manager
Participants: Contingent Workforce Mgr, Procurement (links to VS-34), Legal, User Dept, Safety, Finance
Source: workflow W3216 — Contractor Renewal, Offboarding &amp; Replacement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3216_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3216_Lane1" name="Contingent Workforce Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3216_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3216_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3216_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3216_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3216_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3216_Start3" name="Contract expiry; termination for cause; performance failure">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3216_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3216_Task4" name="Contingent Workforce Mgr/Procurement evaluate renewal vs re-bid vs terminate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Contingent Workforce Mgr/Procurement evaluate renewal vs re-bid vs terminate: performance (W3225), compliance (W3226), market test, cost; obtain decision per authority matrix; for termination, document cause and notice per MSA
Responsible (R): Contingent Workforce Mgr / Procurement
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: 2–4 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3216_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3216_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3216_Task5" name="On non-renewal/termination: manage orderly transition — worker de-badging and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: On non-renewal/termination: manage orderly transition — worker de-badging and access revocation (W3222), asset/tool/uniform recovery (W3222), final invoice reconciliation (W3221), continuity plan (replacement onboarding W3217 or insource W3231), no BuildRight severance obligation to contractor&#x27;s workers (verify no conversion per W3215)
Responsible (R): Contingent Workforce Mgr / User Dept / Safety
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: 2–6 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3216_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3216_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3216_Task6" name="Knowledge transfer and lessons-learned: capture service knowledge, document…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Knowledge transfer and lessons-learned: capture service knowledge, document performance and compliance record for requalification decisions, update supplier register (links to VS-29/VS-03.3 vendor scorecard); archive contract (links to VS-88)
Responsible (R): Contingent Workforce Mgr / Procurement
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: 1–2 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3216_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3216_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3216_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3216_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3216_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-523 (ensure controlled execution — Contingent Workforce Strategy, Sourcing &amp; Compliance (PA-98.1).) | - operational: transition-period clauses and overlap onboarding; operational: clean offboarding and classification discipline (W3215)
Owner: Contingent Workforce Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
